{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_39", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": 54, "width": 700, "height": 474, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_40", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 70, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1222328496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1656961616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - AN ORDER COMES IN FROM EITHER CHANNEL", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - AN ORDER COMES IN FROM EITHER CHANNEL", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_41", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 106, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1490376254, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 96907016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Faire wholesale and Shopify DTC land on separate hooks and get flattened into one shape, so\nevery downstream step reads the same fields no matter which channel sent it.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Faire wholesale and Shopify DTC land on separate hooks and get flattened into one shape, so\nevery downstream step reads the same fields no matter which channel sent it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_42", "type": "rectangle", "x": 776, "y": -38, "width": 2112, "height": 586, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1982966163, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1526706730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_43", "type": "text", "x": 798, "y": -22, "width": 2068, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - THE THREE PLACES IT USUALLY BREAKS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - THE THREE PLACES IT USUALLY BREAKS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_44", "type": "text", "x": 798, "y": 14, "width": 2068, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2120395275, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 253207297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "An unmapped SKU, an Unleashed call that times out or hits a rate limit, and a Xero call on an expired token. Each one gets a gate, and each gate has somewhere safe to put the order instead of dropping it.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "An unmapped SKU, an Unleashed call that times out or hits a rate limit, and a Xero call on an expired token. Each one gets a gate, and each gate has somewhere safe to put the order instead of dropping it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_45", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3086, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 314, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 937195260, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1234510746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_46", "type": "text", "x": 3108, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 555512016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063497604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - CLOSE THE LOOP", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - CLOSE THE LOOP", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_47", "type": "text", "x": 3108, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1708957521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1679116189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The channel gets the fulfilment and invoice number written back, and every run leaves a row\nbehind with timings, so a slow step is visible before it becomes a broken one.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The channel gets the fulfilment and invoice number written back, and every run leaves a row\nbehind with timings, so a slow step is visible before it becomes a broken one.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_48", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3986, "y": 30, "width": 1396, "height": 258, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2132480061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 346094056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_49", "type": "text", "x": 4008, "y": 46, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 714537755, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1929245187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - EVERY MORNING, PROVE IT IS HEALTHY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - EVERY MORNING, PROVE IT IS HEALTHY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_50", "type": "text", "x": 4008, "y": 82, "width": 1352, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1725048951, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1193309984, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A 7am pass over yesterday's log and dead letters, counted and posted. Green means the numbers reconcile. Red names the orders that need a human before anyone has to ask.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A 7am pass over yesterday's log and dead letters, counted and posted. Green means the numbers reconcile. Red names the orders that need a human before anyone has to ask.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_51", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5580, "y": 38, "width": 700, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 588093311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1849076401, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_52", "type": "text", "x": 5602, "y": 54, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1195809358, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1783684942, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_53", "type": "text", "x": 5602, "y": 89, "width": 656, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1540910401, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1633982922, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One error trigger covers every workflow in the instance, so a breakdown announces itself\nwith the workflow, the node and the order id instead of being found days later in a stock\ncount.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "One error trigger covers every workflow in the instance, so a breakdown announces itself\nwith the workflow, the node and the order id instead of being found days later in a stock\ncount.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 168, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_54"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 200.625, "width": 256, "height": 19, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - Faire Wholesale Order", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center"